{"version":1,"content":"<p>就宏福苑大火成立的獨立委員會上周四（22日）向行政長官提交報告。</p><p>據了解，報告內容最快明日（23日）公開，料特首李家超將率領官員舉行記者會，交代全面改革的計劃。</p><p>據悉周五亦將設記者會，由相關官員詳述相關改革工作。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.461631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:22:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T06:38:17.498029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:15.984797+00:00","content_hash":"d78448e2105af20b9772db31f3fad1fefc9c0cb8ffff0fd0643abc808c6ab607","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}